---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/guide.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="匹克球新手指南｜規則、Kitchen、裝備與第一次上場｜PickleStart Taiwan"
  description="第一次接觸匹克球？從匹克球是什麼、5 條必懂規則、Kitchen、Dink、第一次上場，到裝備與預算，一次整理給台灣新手。"
>
  <div class="guide-hub">
    <section class="guide-hub-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">BEGINNER GUIDES</p>
        <h1>第一次接觸匹克球？<br /><span>從這裡開始。</span></h1>
        <p>
          不知道 Kitchen 是廚房還是場地、計分聽起來像密碼，
          甚至還沒拿過球拍都沒關係。我們把第一次上場真正會遇到的問題，
          拆成幾篇看得完、用得上的指南。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-hub-checklist" aria-label="新手指南可以學到什麼">
        <span>看懂規則</span>
        <span>敢第一次上場</span>
        <span>少買不需要的裝備</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-start-here">
      <div class="guide-start-copy">
        <p class="guide-hub-label">START HERE · 5 MIN</p>
        <h2>先搞懂：匹克球到底在玩什麼？</h2>
        <p>
          看起來像網球、球拍又像放大版桌球拍，黃色球上還一堆洞。
          先用 5 分鐘把場地、器材、回合流程和常見術語一次看懂。
        </p>
        <a class="sport-primary sport-primary-small" href="/guide/what-is-pickleball">
          從這篇開始 <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-court-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mini-court">
          <span class="mini-court-net"></span>
          <span class="mini-kitchen mini-kitchen-top">KITCHEN</span>
          <span class="mini-kitchen mini-kitchen-bottom">KITCHEN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-mini-ball"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="guide-mini-paddle"><span></span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-hub-section">
      <div class="guide-hub-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="guide-hub-label">RULES WITHOUT THE RULEBOOK</p>
          <h2>先懂這些，就可以開始打</h2>
        </div>
        <p>不要求你背完整規則書，先把最容易卡住新手的地方弄懂。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-feature-grid">
        <a class="guide-feature-card guide-feature-rules" href="/guide/beginner-rules">
          <span class="guide-card-number">01</span>
          <div class="guide-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <rect x="15" y="9" width="34" height="46" rx="7" fill="#eefbfc" stroke="#087fa5" stroke-width="4"/>
              <path d="M23 23h18M23 32h18M23 41h12" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="m11 43 5 5 10-13" fill="none" stroke="#d7ee28" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <small>第一次上場前</small>
            <h3>只要先懂這 5 條規則</h3>
            <p>發球、Two-Bounce、Kitchen、失誤與最基本計分，一次搞懂。</p>
            <span>閱讀 6 分鐘 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="guide-feature-card guide-feature-kitchen" href="/guide/kitchen-rule">
          <span class="guide-card-number">02</span>
          <div class="guide-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <path d="M9 18h46v28H9z" fill="#e8f8fb" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="4"/>
              <path d="M9 32h46M23 18v28M41 18v28" stroke="#087fa5" stroke-width="3"/>
              <rect x="23" y="25" width="18" height="14" fill="#e2f52c" opacity=".9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <small>最常被問的名詞</small>
            <h3>Kitchen 到底是什麼？</h3>
            <p>可以走進去嗎？踩線算不算？為什麼大家一直站在那條線旁邊？</p>
            <span>3 分鐘看懂 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-hub-section guide-hub-soft">
      <div class="guide-hub-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="guide-hub-label">BEFORE YOUR FIRST GAME</p>
          <h2>比規則更讓新手緊張的，是第一次走進球場</h2>
        </div>
        <p>你不用裝懂。知道怎麼開口、怎麼排隊、先學哪幾種球，就已經很好。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-feature-grid">
        <a class="guide-feature-card" href="/guide/first-game">
          <span class="guide-card-number">03</span>
          <div class="guide-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <circle cx="23" cy="23" r="9" fill="#8ed7e8"/>
              <circle cx="43" cy="24" r="8" fill="#dff52b"/>
              <path d="M10 52c1-12 7-18 14-18s13 6 14 18H10Zm25 0c1-10 5-15 10-15 6 0 10 5 11 15H35Z" fill="#10243f"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <small>第一次去球場</small>
            <h3>到了現場，我到底要做什麼？</h3>
            <p>裝備清單、open play、禮貌用語與第一次上場不尷尬指南。</p>
            <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="guide-feature-card" href="/guide/dink-guide">
          <span class="guide-card-number">04</span>
          <div class="guide-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <path d="M8 43c14-17 27-23 48-19" fill="none" stroke="#087fa5" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="21" r="7" fill="#dff52b" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="2"/>
              <path d="M14 42h36" stroke="#10243f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <small>新手第一個戰術概念</small>
            <h3>Dink 是什麼？為什麼高手不一直猛打？</h3>
            <p>軟球不是示弱。它是在降低對手進攻機會，讓你把回合拉回可控範圍。</p>
            <span>開始認識 Dink →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="guide-hub-section guide-local-discovery">
      <div class="guide-local-discovery-card">
        <div>
          <p class="guide-hub-label">FIND A COURT · TAIWAN</p>
          <h2>規則看懂了，下一個問題是：哪裡可以打？</h2>
          <p>
            從台北到高雄，先整理室內、戶外、固定球敘與新手找場方式。
            有球場不代表隨時有球局，第一次去之前要確認的事也一起幫你整理。
          </p>
          <a href="/courts">
            全台匹克球場地 <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-local-discovery-badges" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>台北</span>
          <span>台中</span>
          <span>台南・高雄</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-hub-section" id="gear-guides">
      <div class="guide-hub-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="guide-hub-label">GEAR, WITHOUT OVERBUYING</p>
          <h2>裝備不用一次買滿</h2>
        </div>
        <p>已經有的先沿用，真正缺的再買。這三篇直接處理最常見的花錢問題。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="visual-guide-grid visual-guide-grid-v3 guide-hub-product-grid">
        <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/beginner-equipment">
          <img src="/images/guide-equipment.webp" alt="匹克球拍、黃色匹克球與球網" />
          <div class="guide-card-copy">
            <h3>第一次打匹克球要買什麼？</h3>
            <p>球拍、球、鞋、球網，哪些現在需要，哪些可以晚點。</p>
            <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/beginner-budget">
          <img src="/images/guide-budget.webp" alt="匹克球拍、匹克球、鞋子與運動裝備" />
          <div class="guide-card-copy">
            <h3>新手預算大概要多少？</h3>
            <p>不是先挑球拍價格，而是先算整套 Starter Kit 還缺什麼。</p>
            <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="visual-guide-card" href="/guide/badminton-shoes">
          <img src="/images/guide-shoes.webp" alt="球場邊的白色場地鞋" />
          <div class="guide-card-copy">
            <h3>羽球鞋可以打匹克球嗎？</h3>
            <p>先看側向支撐與抓地，不要只因為鞋名不同就重買。</p>
            <span>閱讀指南 →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-hub-builder">
      <div>
        <p class="guide-hub-label">READY TO PLAY?</p>
        <h2>懂一點規則之後，裝備就交給 Builder 幫你拆。</h2>
        <p>回答 6 題，依你的場地、預算與現有裝備建立第一套 Starter Kit。</p>
      </div>
      <a
        class="sport-primary"
        href="/builder?from=guide_hub"
        data-analytics-event="guide_builder_clicked"
        data-analytics-detail-event="guide_builder_source"
        data-analytics-placement="guide_hub"
        data-analytics-article="guide_hub"
      >
        建立我的 Starter Kit <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
